title: Public Works
subtitle: Labour: employment, infrastructure or workers’ housing.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_public_works.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'public_works') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.public_works (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.7). Opening and closing the card are free; a
// confirmed option costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser who opened the card. Z — 0.93: a programme starts
// in the decision that chooses it, for one monthly cost; Z — 0.94: the options are actions with their gain and cost.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'public_works');
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_public_works');
!}

= Public works

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

Public works give work to the unemployed with the money of the budget. Unemployment stands at [+ pl_gc_unemployment +]%.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @employment
- @infrastructure
- @housing
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@employment
title: Employ the unemployed on quick works
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month while they run. After three months unemployment falls (−0.5 percentage points) and output rises a little.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'public_works', 'employment').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_public_works_employment_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'public_works', 'employment');
!}
go-to: result

@infrastructure
title: Build roads, railways and bridges
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month, and the first jobs come only after four months. Unemployment falls as much, and output rises more.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'public_works', 'infrastructure').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_public_works_infrastructure_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'public_works', 'infrastructure');
!}
go-to: result

@housing
title: Build workers’ housing
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month and creates no new jobs. After four months the discontent of the workers grows more slowly.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'public_works', 'housing').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_public_works_housing_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'public_works', 'housing');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Public works

[+ pl_gc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
